en:
"From now on, I will sing the songs
that only the person I am now -- older, with the years piled up --
can sing."{w}{p}"Adventurers,{w}thank you, truly!"{w}

"...and as head of this town's guard,
my creed is 'Non-Violence & Reform BY Dialogue'!"{w}{p}"No matter how vicious the criminal, if they share the same kind of soul,{w}a passionate heart and burning words
can always set them straight!"{w}

{0E}"...That said, we're short on people.
Chief Barjeff, show the guard some love already!{0F}
District Nine! Go! Run!"{w}

{0E}"Next time, let's go grab a bite together.
Don't worry, I've got at least that much breathing room............{0F}
What!? Sorry, we'll finish this another time!"{w}

"Love for your friends! Love for your neighbors! Love for neighboring nations!
Love for all! Love shall save the whole wide world!
Ah, what a splendid thing love is!"{w}

"A message from Chief Barjeff.{w}'Deliver this cargo to the Sovereign, Rianna,
at the Roscadil palace,' it says."{w}{p}"It also said, 'As discreetly as you can.'{w}It's a rather bulky parcel, so it may be hard going,
but we're counting on you!"{w}

{0E}"Noraaa?{0F}
How's our customer doing... Aaaaaaah!
Aaaaaaah--!"{w}

"How's this ribbon, debuu?{w}I just bought it, debuu!{w}It's cute, debuu!"{w}{p}"When I make myself cute,
the customers praise me lots, debuu."{w}{p}"Uncle Barjeff
gives me pocket money too, debuu{w}I get pocket money and dress up all nice, debuu!"{w}

"...Sigh.{w}Customer, please say something to her too."{w}{p}"She's a girl, you know?{w}This just won't do..."{w}{p}"Hmm... customer,{w}would you happen to know anywhere that makes
panties Nora could wear?"{w}{p}"We'll pay for them,
so if it's not too much trouble, could you bring some here?"{w}{p}"...Before dressing up,{w}she needs to put on panties first..."{w}
